  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "一见钟情\n\n本：丽丽，你和你男朋友是怎么认识的？\n丽丽：在学生会上认识的。\n本：学生会？\n丽丽：嗯。他是学生会的，我也是学生会的，他大我们三届。那时，我刚进大学，什么都不懂，他帮了我很多忙。\n本：哦，原来是这样。\n丽丽：然后，我们慢慢就熟起来了。后来，他说对我一见钟情，我觉得他人不错，我们就在一起了。",
    "traditional": "一見鐘情\n\n本：麗麗，你和你男朋友是怎麼認識的？\n麗麗：在學生會上認識的。\n本：學生會？\n麗麗：嗯。他是學生會的，我也是學生會的，他大我們三屆。那時，我剛進大學，什麼都不懂，他幫了我很多忙。\n本：哦，原來是這樣。\n麗麗：然後，我們慢慢就熟起來了。後來，他說對我一見鐘情，我覺得他人不錯，我們就在一起了。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Love at First Sight"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：丽丽，你和你男朋友是怎么认识的？",
      "traditional": "本：麗麗，你和你男朋友是怎麼認識的？",
      "pinyin": "běn lì lì nǐ hé nǐ nán péng you shì zěn me rèn shi de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Lili, how did you and your boyfriend get to know each other?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：在学生会上认识的。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：在學生會上認識的。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì zài xué sheng huì shang rèn shi de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: We got to know each other in the student union."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：学生会？",
      "traditional": "本：學生會？",
      "pinyin": "běn xué sheng huì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Student union?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "丽丽：嗯。他是学生会的，我也是学生会的，他大我们三届。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：嗯。他是學生會的，我也是學生會的，他大我們三屆。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì èn tā shì xué sheng huì de wǒ yě shì xué sheng huì de tā dà wǒ men sān jiè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "那时，我刚进大学，什么都不懂，他帮了我很多忙。",
      "traditional": "那時，我剛進大學，什麼都不懂，他幫了我很多忙。",
      "pinyin": "nà shí wǒ gāng jìn dà xué shén me dōu bù dǒng tā bāng le wǒ hěn duō máng",
      "english": "Lili: Yeah. He’s in the student union, and I’m in the student union too. He’s three years above us."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "At the time, I had just started university and didn’t know anything. He helped me out a lot."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "本：哦，原来是这样。",
      "traditional": "本：哦，原來是這樣。",
      "pinyin": "běn ò yuán lái shì zhè yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Oh, I see."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "丽丽：然后，我们慢慢就熟起来了。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：然後，我們慢慢就熟起來了。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì rán hòu wǒ men màn man jiù shóu qǐ lái le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "后来，他说对我一见钟情，",
      "traditional": "後來，他說對我一見鐘情，",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái tā shuō duì wǒ yí jiàn zhōng qíng",
      "english": "Lili: Then we gradually grew closer."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "我觉得他人不错，我们就在一起了。",
      "traditional": "我覺得他人不錯，我們就在一起了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ jué de tā rén bú cuò wǒ men jiù zài yì qǐ le",
      "english": "Later, he told me that he had fallen in love with me at first sight."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I thought that he was a nice guy, so we started dating."
    }
  ],
